{"basis": {"exact_notes_match_count": 0, "non_exact_candidates": [{"document_id": "01kvb9a5cyhz7250rt8kdzcamf", "field": "notes", "highlight_id": "01kvb9brtr1xdqdxffywvkvfz4", "note_sha256": "2d48d60f399e613302c4bc66daf61de5465018e94ef3065be02ef30099d31dbb", "source_record_id": "rwn_b9c38ee7f19456dbb28c1d19", "source_revision_sha256": "f40cf3bc8ab06bc34745ced2b759d7ebcddef8ac052294c3112b85107808bea7"}], "required": "object_id_plus_notes_field_plus_exact_match", "style_inference_used": false}, "eligible_for_user_claim": false, "first_person_allowed": false, "original_record": {"classification_status": "machine_candidate", "content_roles": ["judgment", "question", "viewpoint"], "course": "如实所现", "eligible_for_content_asset": true, "evidence_type": "feynman_answer", "lesson": null, "locator": {"end_line": 115, "entry": 1, "start_line": 99}, "record_id": "utt_8ccd73bbc445d73d", "snapshot_date": "2026-07-14", "snapshot_path": "/Users/housibo/Documents/dbskill-learning-structured-copy/00-原始素材快照/2026-07-14/课程真源/如实所现/10-后记.md", "source_kind": "readwise_backfill", "source_path": "/Users/housibo/Documents/dbskill-learning/如实所现/10-后记.md", "source_relative_path": "如实所现/10-后记.md", "source_set": "course_source", "source_sha256": "913c434941c41e488ebeb699071f977d96fd049ccf4efa23f370d95a7c0b8e56", "speaker": "user", "speaker_verification": "explicit_my_words_label", "verbatim": "你说我能不能把世界还原成真实的尺寸？\n\n第一个是视线。对于你的视角来说，这是一个情绪还是一个结构？为什么对你来说是偏情绪的呢？这是什么原因？是你的情绪太低了，还是说你在逃避这个问题？\n\n让我们用工程化的视角，去解释这个情绪化的原因。原因有哪些呢？\n\n1. 逃避问题而非解决问题\n   你的注意力更多地放在逃避问题，而不是解决问题，这是阿德勒心理学上的观点。\n\n2. 注意力的层层剥削\n   你的注意力其实经过层层剥削，已经剩得不多了。很多广告公司和流媒体公司都想要剥夺你的注意力，你的注意力就是他们的 KPI，是他们的资产。\n\n至于恢复注意力的上限，有哪些方法呢？\n(a) 锻炼\n(b) 睡觉\n(c) 晒太阳\n(d) 低碳饮食", "verbatim_status": "source_exact"}, "original_verbatim_sha256": "b9612398fb35f831a61cf574b7b0802dbbf6b1f0e35252f43c4c947ac8375da1", "policy_version": "readwise-provenance-policy/v1", "quarantine_id": "rwq_0769ef83e6e3922e39d24e05", "reason_code": "transformed_not_verbatim", "record_id": "utt_8ccd73bbc445d73d", "schema_version": "readwise-attribution-quarantine/v1"}
